<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia TCV 2008 bond tender yields 7.6673.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia TCV 2008 bond tender yields 7.6673.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corp of Victoria (TCV) said on Monday its tender of its 7.5 percent August 2008 stock produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 7.6673 percent.  </p>
<p> OFFERED A$100 MLN     COUPON    7.5 PCT    MATURITY  15.08.08</p>
<p> TYPE    SEMI/GOVT     WAY	 7.6673     SETT DATE 05.06.97</p>
<p> ALLOTTED A$100 MLN    RANGE     7.665-7.670</p>
<p>TCV is the central borrowing authority for the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
